  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Action Document for support to water and sanitation Programme in response to the Syrian crisis in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action encompasses the following essential elements:Enhance WASH services in Azraq Refugee Camp by upgrading water supply infrastructure from plot to household level.Establish a comprehensive sanitation network to enhance overall sanitation facilities.Install and rehabilitate private latrines to ensure sufficient and improved sanitation facilities for residents.Provide access to safe and clean water and WASH facilities for refugees and vulnerable Jordanians in informal settlements.</narrative>
  </description>
